            "answer": "<p>The gate hardware collection has hinges, latches and a floor lock for a gate in the same 12 mm glass, all in 2205 stainless. California asks for a pool enclosure at least 60\" high, gaps under 4\" and a latch at least 60\" above the ground. Mount the latch at that height on the 57.7\" panel. Have the City of Carlsbad building division confirm the gate details for your pool.</p>",
