            "text": "<p>Backyard pools in La Costa, Aviara and Bressi Ranch need a 60\" enclosure under California law. Gaps must stay under 4\", with the gate latch 60\" above ground. The 57.7\" panel in spigots gives that height while keeping the yard open to view from the house.</p>"
